exports.interface:
# app/database.py from sqlalchemy import Engine
DATABASE_PATH: Path # <repository root>/link_shelf.db DATABASE_URL: str # "sqlite:///<absolute path to link_shelf.db>" engine: Engine # created with connect_args={"check_same_thread": False}
Import as: `from app.database import engine` `Base.metadata.create_all(bind=engine)` is NOT called at import time. L4-001 calls it for the running application.
